{
  "id": "b12.10-gerund-infinitive",
  "district": "B1.2",
  "order": 10,
  "title": "Герундий или инфинитив",
  "theory": [
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "md": "После одних глаголов — **-ing**: enjoy, avoid, finish, mind, suggest, keep. После других — **to + глагол**: want, decide, hope, promise, agree, refuse, plan. После предлогов — всегда **-ing**: good **at** swimming, before **leaving**."
    },
    {
      "kind": "table",
      "head": [
        "+ -ing",
        "+ to"
      ],
      "rows": [
        {
          "cells": [
            "enjoy walking",
            "want to walk"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "avoid lying",
            "refuse to lie"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "finish reading",
            "decide to read"
          ]
        },
        {
          "cells": [
            "keep trying",
            "hope to see"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "tip",
      "md": "Как подлежащее чаще -ing: **Swimming** is good for you."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "es": "I enjoy walking by the sea.",
      "ru": "Я люблю гулять у моря."
    },
    {
